{"ID":"20260203094519-qxx8y9q","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"icon":"1f3ab","id":"20260203094519-qxx8y9q","tags":"R-CNN框架,神经网络基础学习,目标检测","title":"R-CNN","type":"doc","updated":"20260207103541"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260207103030-6fkv4zy","Type":"NodeCallout","Properties":{"id":"20260207103030-6fkv4zy","updated":"20260207103423"},"CalloutType":"NOTE","CalloutTitle":"Note","CalloutIcon":"✏️","Children":[{"ID":"20260207103039-f8992n6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207103039-f8992n6","updated":"20260207103302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"R-CNN的出现应该是一个比较历程杯意义的。"}]},{"ID":"20260207103310-wl8lxbc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207103310-wl8lxbc","updated":"20260207103310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之前的人们主要做的事情是图像分类，无论是CNN的创始名著"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260201125229-m656ezj","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"LeNet-5"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、亦或是现阶段引用最多的文章"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260206192508-7vlgudd","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"ResNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他们做的均是图像分类，尤其是在ImageNet上进行的图像分类。"}]},{"ID":"20260207103302-za0vakw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207103302-za0vakw","updated":"20260207103422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是，随着时代的逐步发展，单单进行图像分类这个事情已经不足以支撑后面的研究了，人们逐渐聚焦于一种新的事情-图像目标检测任务。这个任务应该就是R-CNN出现的目的。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260207103423-9kgkp7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207103423-9kgkp7y","updated":"20260207103507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260207103507-ihqsqa9.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260203104217-ilxq3hp","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260203104217-ilxq3hp","updated":"20260207103541"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260207103517-vptkrjz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207103517-vptkrjz","updated":"20260207103541"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"R-CNN"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原文"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Rich feature hierarchies for accurate object detection and semantic segmentation Tech report (v5)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是"}]}]},{"ID":"20260207103536-qe9ez8v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207103536-qe9ez8v","updated":"20260207103536"}}]}